       "id": "Paragraph-24",
       "html": "The row to watch at this party is <strong>8:00pm</strong>. In our experience, remarks at a holiday party can start late and run long, and by then your guests have usually been at the bar for a while. We'd suggest putting a hard end time in the document and giving it to your speakers ahead of time. We can bring the band back up on time either way.",
